{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2022-03-30 08:15:00', 'title': 'PALO ALTO NETWORKS LAUNCHES A MANAGED NEXT-GENERATION FIREWALL SERVICE FOR AWS TO ACCELERATE ENTERPRISE JOURNEY TO CLOUD', 'text': 'CLOUD NGFW FOR AWS BRINGS TOGETHER PALO ALTO NETWORKS SECURITY WITH AWS SIMPLICITY AND SCALE SANTA CLARA, CALIF. , MARCH 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW), A 10-TIME LEADER IN NETWORK FIREWALLS , TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS TEAMED UP WITH AMAZON WEB SERVICES (AWS) TO UNVEIL THE NEW PALO ALTO NETWORKS CLOUD NGFW FOR AWS — A MANAGED NEXT-GENERATION FIREWALL (NGFW) SERVICE DESIGNED TO SIMPLIFY SECURING AWS DEPLOYMENTS — ENABLING ORGANIZATIONS TO SPEED THEIR PACE OF INNOVATION WHILE REMAINING HIGHLY SECURE.'}